        ["Analysing Angola","Produzir análises equilibradas sobre geografia, economia e sociedade. Gramática: hedging e concessive clauses.","While Angola has significant natural resources, sustainable development also depends on education and infrastructure.",[["sustainable","sustentável","sas-têi-na-bol"],["infrastructure","infra-estrutura","in-fra-strâk-tcher"],["resources","recursos","ri-zór-siz"],["development","desenvolvimento","di-vé-lop-ment"],["to assess","avaliar","a-sés"]],"Which phrase signals cautious analysis?",["It is undoubtedly the only cause.","It may be one contributing factor.","Everyone knows the reason."],1],
        ["Academic reading and writing","Resumir, comparar fontes e construir parágrafos coesos. Gramática: nominalisation, complex sentences e referencing language.","The preservation of cultural heritage requires coordinated efforts across institutions and communities.",[["evidence","evidência","é-vi-dens"],["source","fonte","sórs"],["argument","argumento","ár-giu-ment"],["findings","resultados","fáin-dings"],["to preserve","preservar","pri-zârv"]],"What should a reliable summary do?",["Add unsupported opinions.","Represent the source accurately.","Copy unrelated details."],1],
        ["Leadership and public speaking","Apresentar propostas, responder a perguntas e gerir objecções. Gramática: rhetorical emphasis e signposting.","What matters most is not only the proposal itself, but how it benefits the community.",[["stakeholder","parte interessada","stêik-hôul-der"],["outcome","resultado","áut-kâm"],["challenge","desafio","tchá-lendj"],["to implement","implementar","ím-pli-ment"],["to address","abordar","a-drés"]],"Which expression introduces a new point?",["Moving on to the next issue","In the middle of nowhere","Once upon a time"],0]
