      'A1': ['Present simple: affirmative, negative and questions.','Verb to be and have got.','Subject/object pronouns and possessive adjectives.','Articles a/an/the and plural forms.','There is/there are and quantifiers some/any.','Adverbs of frequency and word order.','Can/can’t for ability and permission.','Prepositions of time and place.','Present continuous for actions happening now.','Countable and uncountable nouns.'],
      'A2': ['Past simple: regular and irregular verbs.','Past continuous and past simple contrast.','Future plans with going to and arrangements with present continuous.','Will for predictions and spontaneous decisions.','Comparatives and superlatives.','Countable/uncountable nouns; much, many, a few, a little.','Present perfect with ever, never, just, already and yet.','Should, must, have to and mustn’t.','First conditional: if + present, will + infinitive.','Infinitive of purpose and gerunds after common verbs.'],
